window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three days. Three questions. Three answers. </p> <p>Running away isn't an option any more for Will Chambers. Despite being a linguistic tutor and having every conversational tool at his disposal, all Will wants to do is fade into the background, become lost in the echo of wild heath and harbor. But now someone wants to put his mind on full display, force Will to find his voice - answer three questions, over three days.</p> <p>All Will has to do is provide three...simple...answers.</p>"; 
